# slug: ch80-query
# source: chapters/ch80.tex:124
# label: alg:ch80-query
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch80.tex:127
# caption: Publish spellchecking results only after complete bounded search.

REQUIRE dictionary FST, query, radius, positive result limit and expansion budget
ENSURE ranked complete top results, or explicit failure without success output
validate and canonicalize query
run implicit product search, retaining all within-radius accepted words
IF state expansion budget is exhausted THEN
  report incomplete search; do not publish candidate JSON
END IF
sort by cost, negative frequency, and canonical spelling
publish the requested prefix of the sorted candidate list

